    "commentsEn": "<ul>\r\n\t<li>On November 12, 2024, ACWA Power Co. announced that it received a notice from the project company confirming the receipt of a commercial operation certificate from Saudi Power Procurement Co. (SPPC) for the full project capacity of 600 MW.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
